<title>USA: Vencor to issue up to $500 mln senior notes.</title>
<headline>Vencor to issue up to $500 mln senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vencor Inc said Friday it plans to issue up to $500 million in senior subordinated notes to 2007.</p>
<p>The company said the offering is expected to be completed in July.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the proceeds from the offering to refinance debt incurred as part of its purchase of Transitional Hospitals Corp.</p>
</text>
